/1.1:jdk10\r\nAlso, make sure your build does not have the following (RBE recommended) flags:\r\n--java_toolchain=@bazel_tools//tools/jdk:toolchain_hostjdk8 / --host_java_toolchain=@bazel_tools//tools/jdk:toolchain_hostjdk8\r\n\r\nThough this fixes the breakage, could @cushon please comment on whether we should now not expect to be able to compile Bazel with host_javabase pointing to a jdk8 (if so, it would be ideal to try to get this behind a --incompatible_xxx flag so we can follow breaking change policy?).\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/429857339/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nlopezgi","id":4062751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjI3NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4062751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi","html_url":"https://github.com/nlopezgi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlopezgi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1904125069,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTkwNDEyNTA2OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/1904125069","actor":{"login":"cushon","id":478458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODQ1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith